# gemma-4-26b-a4b-tf on a Mac: TensorFold 0.6.6 (MLX), Gemma 4 26B-A4B (a mixture
# of experts, 4B active). No drafts: 0.6.6 drafts Gemma 4 only with a DFlash draft
# model, and none is published for it; its gain here is the engine alone, as
# qwen36-a3b-tf-nodraft measured (+46% over llama.cpp for Qwen3.6 A3B).
#
# 1 FIT     MLX 4-bit, groups of 64 (routers 8-bit): 15.3 GB. Fits from a 32 GB
#           Mac with a 65536-token window.
WEIGHTS_GB=15.3
# 2 ENGINE  TensorFold at rack's pinned commit, in its own venv.
ENGINE=tensorfold
# 3 ACCESS  mlx-community's conversion, the one TensorFold names for Gemma 4; pinned.
. "$RECIPE_DIR/model.env"
ARTIFACT=mlx-community/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it-4bit
ARTIFACT_REVISION=0d77464eeb233a2da68ebf9d7dc4edaac7db956d
SERVE_ARGS=(
  # 4 SHAPE   rack up sets --host, --port, --name, --api-key-file, --no-update-check.
  --context 65536
  --parallel 4
)
ENV_EXTRA=()
# 8 PROOF   not yet benched: rack up gemma-4-26b-a4b-tf --mac && rack bench gemma-4-26b-a4b-tf
